14B. Do Exercise 13.4, Level 2, "What git

199
00:16:24,208 --> 00:16:28,928
describe prints", and Exercise 13.8,
Level 3, "One name, two refs", in

200
00:16:28,968 --> 00:16:31,919
exercises/m11-m15-investigation-recovery.md.

201
00:16:32,259 --> 00:16:36,528
Today you read a version string back into
the graph, and you found which releases

202
00:16:36,568 --> 00:16:40,890
contain a fix. Before the next video, run
git describe in the lab, and predict the

203
00:16:40,930 --> 00:16:44,986
string first. Next time: linked worktrees,
what is shared, and one branch per

204
00:16:45,026 --> 00:16:48,284
worktree. Until then, look at
